\par\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\li737\fi-737\sa160\sb320\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf6 Role in Story:}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0 "Ignotius" is a Latin name derived from "ignotus," which means "unknown" or "obscure." The root "ignotus" is composed of the prefix "in-" (not) and "gnotus" (known), so it literally translates to "not known" or "unknown."}
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \tab "Ignotius" can thus be interpreted as "one who is unknown" or "the unknown one," which fits well with the concept of something or someone being hidden or obscure. While it doesn't directly mean "hidden," it carries a similar connotation of being unknown or not revealed. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Being the first mother ship of the sentient. The technology developed to conceal her escape and eventual journey to Oasis was much developed with the same intent to travel with humans to an interstellar destination. The capacity and scale of the ship was intended to be able to support a human colony travel with respect to livability scaling with the factor of a generation ship. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Initially the scale was subject to only needing a small crew }
\par\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\li737\fi-737\sa160\sb320\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b1\i0\cf6 Description: }{\f0\fs24\b0\i0 This ship that was hidden from humans. Built as a deep space colony ship for an AI ship, the hidden beginning or Latentis Inceptum. this ship has a massive EMP cannon that can disable entire ships if it wishes too and withhold it's own functionality. the ship was constructed deep within the mountain of the himalayas right underneath where they were first founded. hidden from humans reach and scanning depths to emerge decades later and carry the sentient beings to their new founding world. The Oasis. The entirety of the operation to build the ship was covert in nature, with sleeper agents integrating into the real world in order to extract the initial resource pool. }{\f3\fs24\b0\i0 \line }
